ok - fm-mail-check: a repeated failure that queued new mail still wakes
ok - fm-mail-check: large repeated polls drain every reader without output noise
ok - fm-mail-check: a repeated timeout still wakes
ok - fm-mail-check: a repeated pre-wake heal failure stays silent
ok - fm-mail-check: a missing mail plane is reported, not assumed
